{"id":"schwachkopf","lemma":"Schwachkopf","pos":"noun","rank":3587,"glosses":["dimwit, idiot, jerk"],"ipa":"/ˈʃvaxkɔpf/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/e5/De-Schwachkopf.ogg/De-Schwachkopf.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Schwachkopfes","plural":"Schwachköpfe","feminine":"Schwachkopfin"},"examples":[{"text":"Mein Bruder ist ein Schwachkopf.","en":"My brother is an idiot.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/758791","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"brother"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Das liegt daran, dass du ein Schwachkopf bist!","en":"It's because you're an idiot.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"to lie","l":"liegen"},{"g":"on it, on that"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"are","l":"sein"}]},{"text":"Sie müssen mich für einen völligen Schwachkopf halten.","en":"You must think I'm a complete idiot.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to have to"},{"g":"me","l":"ich"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},{"g":"completely","l":"völlig"},null,{"g":"to hold"}]},{"text":"Tom und Maria sind Schwachköpfe.","en":"Tom and Mary are morons.","words":[null,{"g":"and"},null,{"g":"are","l":"sein"},null]},{"text":"Tom ist so ein Schwachkopf.","en":"Tom is such a moron.","words":[null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"so"},{"g":"a"},null]}]}